# FRAMEWORK-SPECIFIC RULES
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

## ISO 27001:2022
- Reference Annex A controls (A.5 through A.8)
- Use clause numbers for ISMS requirements (4-10)
- Consider Statement of Applicability (SoA)
- Track mandatory documented information

## SOC 2 Type II
- Map to Trust Services Criteria (CC, A, PI, C, P)
- Consider points of focus
- Track control operating effectiveness
- Document testing period (minimum 6 months)

## PCI-DSS v4.0
- Reference 12 requirements and sub-requirements
- Consider SAQ type if applicable
- Track compensating controls
- Document scope reduction measures

## GDPR
- Reference articles and recitals
- Consider data subject rights
- Track lawful basis for processing
- Document DPIAs when required

## HIPAA
- Distinguish Privacy Rule vs Security Rule
- Track PHI handling
- Document BAAs with vendors
- Consider state-specific requirements

## NIST CSF 2.0
- Use Function.Category.Subcategory notation
- Consider implementation tiers (1-4)
- Track profile alignment
- Document informative references

