## Naming Conventions
- Policies: POL-[CAT]-[NUM]-v[VER].md
- Procedures: PRO-[CAT]-[NUM]-v[VER].md
- Controls: CTRL-[NUM].yaml
- Risks: RISK-[YEAR]-[NUM].yaml
- Audits: AUD-[YEAR]-[NUM]/
- Findings: FIND-[AUD]-[NUM].yaml
- Evidence: EVD-[CTRL]-[DATE]-[DESC].[ext]

## Directory Usage
- `/policies/` - Approved policies only
- `/procedures/` - Operational procedures
- `/audits/` - Audit documentation and results
- `/risks/` - Risk register and assessments
- `/compliance/` - Compliance evidence by framework
- `/frameworks/` - Framework reference materials
- `/controls/` - Control definitions and mappings
- `/templates/` - Document templates
- `/reports/` - Generated reports
- `/evidence/` - Evidence repository

